From: Nan <nan@modal.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Skip worker discovery for an opaque rollout endpoint

Backport the worker-discovery hunk from af40a6c310e3981fc627e63f5422bfdfb988729d
(https://github.com/radixark/miles/pull/3236).

diff --git a/miles/rollout/inference_rollout/inference_rollout_train.py b/miles/rollout/inference_rollout/inference_rollout_train.py
--- a/miles/rollout/inference_rollout/inference_rollout_train.py
+++ b/miles/rollout/inference_rollout/inference_rollout_train.py
@@ -54,6 +54,8 @@
 
 
 async def get_worker_urls(args: Namespace):
+    if args.rollout_endpoint_url is not None:
+        return []
     if parse(sglang_router.__version__) <= parse("0.2.1") or args.use_miles_router:
         response = await get(f"http://{args.sglang_router_ip}:{args.sglang_router_port}/list_workers")
         urls = response["urls"]
